## Things I resolved along the way

- The **full JVM lane** needed >10 min (killed once at the background limit, re-run green with a 1h limit).
- The **Node compile** failed with `UnsupportedClassVersionError` — the default `clj` runs Java 17, but shadow-cljs needs **Java 21**; fixed via `mise exec java@21`.
- **clj-kondo/cljstyle** aren't on the default PATH but are reachable through `mise`.

